# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sync (optional) — feature flag
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The app is local-first: IndexedDB is the source of truth and every feature
# works with NO env vars set. Sync is strictly opt-in.
#
# To enable the HTTP adapter, set PUBLIC_SYNC_ENDPOINT to a URL that implements
# the JSON contract documented in src/lib/services/syncAdapter.ts:
#
#   POST  {endpoint}/push  { changes: SyncChange[] }        -> { accepted: string[] }
#   GET   {endpoint}/pull?since=<cursor>                    -> { changes, cursor? }
#
# SECURITY: PUBLIC_* variables are embedded in the CLIENT bundle. Never put a
# long-lived secret here. Use a public, revocable endpoint token at most.
#
# Leave these unset (or remove the file) for a local-only production build.
# PUBLIC_SYNC_ENDPOINT=https://example.com/api/sync
# PUBLIC_SYNC_TOKEN=
